# w3-c — the interleaved wand (mirrors demos/11-noita/w3-modifier-chain.bqn, the interleaved section)
# Same wand as w3-b; no srel — the bind column is computed in-program (reverse min-scan along revDeck)
# and stands in relation position itself: the value-level rel.
n 7
col keys num 0 1 2 3 4 5 6
col wand bool 1 0 0 0 0 0 0
col spell bool 0 1 1 1 1 1 1
col slot num -1 0 1 2 3 4 5
col proj bool 0 0 0 1 0 1 1
col mod bool 0 1 0 0 1 0 0
col multi bool 0 0 1 0 0 0 0
col drawAdd num 0 1 3 0 1 0 0
col damage num 0 0 0 3 0 3 3
col bal num 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
col minBal num 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
col member bool 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
col bind num 0 0 0 0 0 0 0
bind deck mask 1 1 1 1 1 1 1
bind revDeck vec 6 5 4 3 2 1
ja 杖 wand
ja 呪文 spell
ja 枠 slot
ja 投射 proj
ja 改 mod
ja 抜追加 drawAdd
ja 損傷 damage
ja 残高 bal
ja 最低残高 minBal
ja 成員 member
ja 山札 deck
ja 逆山札 revDeck
